  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.casing_forming.header": "使用模具制造弹壳",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.casing_forming.text_1": "右击模具，可以选择要制造的弹壳口径。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.casing_forming.text_2": "将设好口径的模具交给机械手。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.casing_forming.text_3": "机械手使用模具，将金属加工成对应的弹壳。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.casing_forming.text_4": "新制弹壳和回收弹壳都可用于再装填。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.casing_forming.text_5": "加工不会消耗模具，可以取回并重新选择口径。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.casing_reloading.header": "使用弹壳再装填",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.casing_reloading.text_1": "使用动力搅拌器，将火药加工成流态火药。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.casing_reloading.text_2": "使用管道，将流态火药送入注液器。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.casing_reloading.text_3": "注液器会为下方的弹壳装入流态火药。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.casing_reloading.text_4": "部分弹药还需要机械手加入金属或其他材料。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.casing_reloading.text_5": "最后经过冲压，弹壳便被装成一发子弹。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.casing_reloading.text_6": "装药量较大时，需要经过多次注液。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.casing_reloading.text_7": "将未完成的弹壳单独放入合成栏，可以取回空壳。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.casing_collection.header": "收集弹壳",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.casing_collection.text_1": "将弹壳收集器放在哨戒动力臂旁。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.casing_collection.text_2": "射击产生的弹壳会直接存入收集器。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.casing_collection.text_3": "使用漏斗等物流组件，可以取出收集器内的物品。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.casing_collection.text_4": "收集器装满后，无法存入的部分会落在地上。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.casing_collection.text_5": "在动态结构上，动力臂会使用同一结构内的收集器。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.casing_collection.text_6": "玩家射击产生的弹壳默认存入背包。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.casing_collection.text_7": "背包放不下的弹壳会在玩家身旁掉落。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.sentry_depot_supply.header": "使用弹药库补给",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.sentry_depot_supply.text_1": "为哨戒动力臂装上匹配的弹药盒。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.sentry_depot_supply.text_2": "相邻弹药库中的弹药会补充到弹药盒内。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.sentry_depot_supply.text_3": "在动态结构上，动力臂也能使用结构内的弹药库。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.sentry_depot_supply.text_4": "弹药不足时，可查看动力臂的补给提示。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.sentry_depot_supply.text_5": "通过物流持续补充弹药库，就能维持供弹。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.sentry_targeting.header": "使用瞄准镜指挥",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.sentry_targeting.text_1": "使用扳手连接火控台与哨戒动力臂。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.sentry_targeting.text_2": "黑名单指定攻击目标，白名单指定需要保护的目标。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.sentry_targeting.text_3": "手持许可潜行右击，可以将自己加入名单。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.sentry_targeting.text_4": "手持瞄准镜潜行右击火控台，即可绑定。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.sentry_targeting.text_5": "使用瞄准镜时，左击实体可指挥动力臂集火。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.sentry_targeting.text_6": "中键可以标记位置，引导爆炸武器攻击。",
  "sentrymechanicalarm.ponder.sentry_targeting.text_7": "动力臂仍需有效动力、足够弹药，并处于射程内。",
